ldData}_S(\nH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,n,n-1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hypersurface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S(H,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(\nH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,n,n-1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient dimension and the hypersurface dimension now belong to one explicit embedded-submanifold witness. Separate existential manifold and embeddedness calls could choose incompatible atlases or ambient dimensions.</li>\n<li>Hypersurface: codimension-1 submanifold</li>\n<li>Examples: sphere <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{n-1} \\subset \\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(S^{n-1} \\subset \\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>, level sets of smooth functions</li>\n<li>Divisor: hypersurface in complex manifolds</li>\n<li>A regular level set is a downstream sufficient construction of a hypersurface; closedness and orientability require additional hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S$ (fully explicit embedded-submanifold predicate; see [[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,H,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hypersurface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S(H,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifoldData}_S(\nH,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,n,n-1).","display":true},{"tex":"S^{n-1} \\subset \\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"1946c1e666e6036a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Manifold}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]])"},{"id":"2dd1386ba4ddb99c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hypersurf}_S$ (hypersurface predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-653","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-hypersurface.md|58-df-hypersurface]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["432be048cd519891"]}